Complete synchronous kernel file-information requests before returning their
stack-resident status blocks. Use the same deferred-completion path as the
native query/set services; pending I/O still waits on the appropriate event.
On 4fbbefd614b, x64 Debug FAT installation with the historical image fixes
stopped in the MSVC stack check after a late I/O completion during section
creation. The saved IRP status destination overlapped the reported guard.

